{
    "title": "PicCollage: Photo Grid Editor",
    "description": "<b>PicCollage - Your Photo Collage Maker for Celebrating Life's Moments!</b> \r\n\r\nTransform your memories into stunning photo collage with PicCollage, the best photo collage maker for creating captivating visual stories. Our intuitive collage maker, coupled with a wide selection of grid and layout options, makes turning your photo and video into beautiful collages effortless.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Create photo collages, video collages, greeting cards, Insta stories & more.\r\n- Edit photos & videos easily with filter, effects, retouch, and crop\r\n- Remove & change backgrounds with AI technology\r\n- Use ready-to-use layouts, grids & animated templates.\r\n- Decorate with fonts, stickers, and doodles.\r\n\r\nPHOTO GRID & LAYOUT\r\nOrganize multiple photos into a single, stunning collage with our photo grid feature. Choose from our extensive photo grid library to stitch together your collage masterpiece! Whether it's a simple two-photo layout or a complex multi-photo grid, PicCollage offers the perfect photo collage layout for every need. Customize your grid sizes and background to create the ideal photo collage.\r\n\r\nGRID\r\nHave a plethora of photos? Our grid system allows for endless creativity. From simple two-photo grids to complex multi-photo layouts, PicCollage's grid options cater to all your needs. Customize grid and backgrounds to create the perfect photo collage. Enhance your layout with our diverse grid designs to make your collages truly unique.\r\n\r\nCOLLAGE MAKER TEMPLATE\r\nExplore our latest template and transform your seasonal photos! From Magic Cutouts and filter template to Slideshow layout, our collage maker has you covered for all occasions, from Christmas celebrations to yearly round-ups.\r\n\r\nCUTOUT & DESIGN\r\nMake your photo collage subjects pop with our cutout tool. Remove backgrounds to isolate subjects, perfect for creating standout collage. Our massive library of template, stickers, and backgrounds is constantly refreshed, allowing you to add unique elements to your grid or layout.\r\n\r\nFONTS & DOODLE\r\nIntegrate text into your photo collage effortlessly with our curved text editor and font pairing suggestions. Add a personal touch to your layouts with the doodle feature \u2013 a simple doodle can elevate the uniqueness of your grid collage.\r\n\r\nANIMATION & VIDEO COLLAGE MAKER\r\nBring your photo collage to life with animations. Our video collage maker allows you to combine photos and videos, crafting dynamic visual stories. Enhance your collages with our photo video editor, complete with filters and effects.\r\n\r\nPICCOLLAGE VIP\r\nUpgrade your photo collage making experience with PicCollage VIP. Enjoy ad-free access, watermark removal, and premium features including exclusive stickers, backgrounds, photo collage templates, and fonts. Start with our 7-day free trial to explore all VIP features. \r\n\r\nElevate your photo and collage game with PicCollage \u2013 the ultimate photo collage maker that helps you make anything to celebrate everything!\r\n\r\nFor more detailed terms of service: http://cardinalblue.com/tos\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://picc.co/privacy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>PicCollage - Your Photo Collage Maker for Celebrating Life&#39;s Moments!</b> <br><br>Transform your memories into stunning photo collage with PicCollage, the best photo collage maker for creating captivating visual stories. Our intuitive collage maker, coupled with a wide selection of grid and layout options, makes turning your photo and video into beautiful collages effortless.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Create photo collages, video collages, greeting cards, Insta stories &amp; more.<br>- Edit photos &amp; videos easily with filter, effects, retouch, and crop<br>- Remove &amp; change backgrounds with AI technology<br>- Use ready-to-use layouts, grids &amp; animated templates.<br>- Decorate with fonts, stickers, and doodles.<br><br>PHOTO GRID &amp; LAYOUT<br>Organize multiple photos into a single, stunning collage with our photo grid feature. Choose from our extensive photo grid library to stitch together your collage masterpiece! Whether it&#39;s a simple two-photo layout or a complex multi-photo grid, PicCollage offers the perfect photo collage layout for every need. Customize your grid sizes and background to create the ideal photo collage.<br><br>GRID<br>Have a plethora of photos? Our grid system allows for endless creativity. From simple two-photo grids to complex multi-photo layouts, PicCollage&#39;s grid options cater to all your needs. Customize grid and backgrounds to create the perfect photo collage. Enhance your layout with our diverse grid designs to make your collages truly unique.<br><br>COLLAGE MAKER TEMPLATE<br>Explore our latest template and transform your seasonal photos! From Magic Cutouts and filter template to Slideshow layout, our collage maker has you covered for all occasions, from Christmas celebrations to yearly round-ups.<br><br>CUTOUT &amp; DESIGN<br>Make your photo collage subjects pop with our cutout tool. Remove backgrounds to isolate subjects, perfect for creating standout collage. Our massive library of template, stickers, and backgrounds is constantly refreshed, allowing you to add unique elements to your grid or layout.<br><br>FONTS &amp; DOODLE<br>Integrate text into your photo collage effortlessly with our curved text editor and font pairing suggestions. Add a personal touch to your layouts with the doodle feature \u2013 a simple doodle can elevate the uniqueness of your grid collage.<br><br>ANIMATION &amp; VIDEO COLLAGE MAKER<br>Bring your photo collage to life with animations. Our video collage maker allows you to combine photos and videos, crafting dynamic visual stories. Enhance your collages with our photo video editor, complete with filters and effects.<br><br>PICCOLLAGE VIP<br>Upgrade your photo collage making experience with PicCollage VIP. Enjoy ad-free access, watermark removal, and premium features including exclusive stickers, backgrounds, photo collage templates, and fonts. Start with our 7-day free trial to explore all VIP features. <br><br>Elevate your photo and collage game with PicCollage \u2013 the ultimate photo collage maker that helps you make anything to celebrate everything!<br><br>For more detailed terms of service: http://cardinalblue.com/tos<br>Privacy Policy: https://picc.co/privacy/",
